# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:9
translate italian dana0_4b30accf:

    # "I decide to go back inside the office and chat with Dana a little bit more. I turn off the car and walk back into the building."
    "Decido di tornare in ufficio e chiacchierare ancora un po’ con Dana. Spengo il motore e torno a piedi nell’edificio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:11
translate italian dana0_bfd0c735:

    # cw "Oh hey, did you forget something?"
    cw "Oh, ehi, hai dimenticato qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:12
translate italian dana0_003419c5:

    # pc "No, I just wanted to come in and chat for a bit."
    pc "No, volevo solo entrare a fare due chiacchiere."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:14
translate italian dana0_928517bb:

    # cw "Oh, with me?"
    cw "Oh, con me?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:15
translate italian dana0_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:17
translate italian dana0_cce31900:

    # "Dana's face grows a bit red."
    "Il viso di Dana arrossisce leggermente."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:18
translate italian dana0_bb093f6c:

    # cw "Oh, well I'm kind of busy right now. I have to organize all this stuff before I can go home, and I have to be home at seven."
    cw "Oh, beh, in realtà sono un po’ impegnata in questo momento. Devo sistemare tutta questa roba prima di poter andare a casa, e devo essere a casa alle sette."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:22
translate italian dana0_356ae111:

    # cw "You would do that? Sure, pull up a chair."
    cw "Lo faresti? Certo, prendi una sedia."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:26
translate italian dana0_8dbdc8d1:

    # cw "No problem. See you Monday."
    cw "Nessun problema. Ci vediamo lunedì."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:29
translate italian dana0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/dana_seeyoutomorrow.mp3"
    voice "voices/dana_seeyoutomorrow.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:30
translate italian dana0_9da3accd:

    # cw "No problem. See you tomorrow."
    cw "Nessun problema. Ci vediamo domani."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:31
translate italian dana0_e8e6d974:

    # "I head back to the car and leave."
    "Torno alla macchina e me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:36
translate italian dana0_b791cdf1:

    # "I take one of the chairs and pull it over next to her. I spend the next hour going through the stacks of paper on her desk and sorting them by date."
    "Prendo una delle sedie e la avvicino a lei. Passo l’ora successiva a sfogliare le pile di fogli sulla sua scrivania e a ordinarli per data."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:37
translate italian dana0_34290a3e:

    # "It is easy work and Dana is good company. We don't talk much, but every time I catch her eye, she is smiling."
    "È un lavoro facile e Dana è di buona compagnia. Non parliamo molto, ma ogni volta che incrocio il suo sguardo, lei sorride."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:38
translate italian dana0_2dbc8990:

    # "We finish just before seven."
    "Finiamo poco prima delle sette."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:41
translate italian dana0_02cb5af0:

    # cw "Oh my God, thank you so much for helping me. There's no way I would've finished it in time if you weren't here."
    cw "Oh mio Dio, grazie mille per avermi aiutata. Non ce l’avrei mai fatta in tempo se non fossi stata qui."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:42
translate italian dana0_a7c1d064:

    # pc "No problem. Glad to help."
    pc "Nessun problema. Felice di averti aiutata."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:43
translate italian dana0_3a92acde:

    # cw "You're the best. I have to run though, so I'll see you later, okay?"
    cw "Sei la migliore. Devo scappare però, quindi ci vediamo più tardi, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:44
translate italian dana0_82f4d7ef:

    # "I don't really want to say goodbye to her, and I get a sudden burst of courage."
    "Non ho proprio voglia di dirle addio, e mi viene un improvviso slancio di coraggio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:45
translate italian dana0_4005f1c2:

    # pc "I'm kind of hungry. Want to grab a bite to eat somewhere?"
    pc "Ho un po’ di fame. Ti va di andare a mangiare un boccone da qualche parte?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:47
translate italian dana0_a9645bb5:

    # "Her smile fades away a bit."
    "Il suo sorriso si affievolisce un po’."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:49
translate italian dana0_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/dana_sortofengaged.mp3"
    voice "voices/dana_sortofengaged.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:50
translate italian dana0_92e7ded7:

    # cw "I'm not sure that's a good idea. I'm sort of engaged. I don't think he'd like to see me talking to other guys outside of work."
    cw "Non sono sicura che sia una buona idea. Sono più o meno fidanzata. Non credo che gli farebbe piacere vedermi parlare con altri ragazzi fuori dal lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:51
translate italian dana0_1dad11d2:

    # pc "Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to make you feel uncomfortable."
    pc "Oh, mi dispiace. Non volevo metterti a disagio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:53
translate italian dana0_094901ac:

    # voice dana_seeyoulater
    # cw "It's okay. I'll see you later, okay?"
    voice dana_seeyoulater
    cw ""

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:57
translate italian dana0_437e96ea:

    # "She smiles and guides me out the front door so that she can start closing up the office."
    "Lei sorride e mi accompagna fuori dalla porta d’ingresso per poter iniziare a chiudere l’ufficio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:58
translate italian dana0_7679afbc:

    # "Struck out. Oops. Maybe I shouldn't have pushed it? Oh well."
    "Ho fallito. Ops. Forse non avrei dovuto insistere? Vabbè."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:59
translate italian dana0_75b9bff6:

    # "I head back to the car."
    "Torno alla macchina."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:1
    old "Dana needs some help with her paperwork after work."
    new "Dana ha bisogno di aiuto con le pratiche dopo il lavoro."

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:2
    old "You could help her any weekday evening after you finish work."
    new "Potresti aiutarla qualsiasi sera nei giorni feriali dopo aver finito di lavorare."

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:20
    old "Maybe I could help you sort?"
    new "Magari potrei aiutarti a sistemare?"

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana0.rpy:23
    old "Oh, I'll leave you be then."
    new "Oh, allora ti lascio in pace."

